# J4: the prefix-reuse (G1) bring-up gate at TP4 (after J2 and J3 pass)
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the TP4 bring-up (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env, commit, and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig,
# a card or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time.
# Duration (estimate, wall clock; the workflow's step limits in parentheses): reset 3-12 min; the bringup plan: 60-120 min (step 380).
# general-prefix-tp4 against its no-reuse baseline general-tp4: grants disabled equals the baseline byte for byte, the first hit compiles nothing, the install and platform lines. Longer plans (exactness, lifecycle, timing) are one or two per tag.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset prefix
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-1
C2_PROFILE=general-prefix-tp4
C2_PREFIX_PLAN=bringup
C2_PREFIX_PROFILE=general-prefix-tp4
C2_PREFIX_BASELINE=general-tp4
